{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"「Steam Deck」8月25日に再入荷へ。値上げ後も“即品切れ”の根強い人気、2か月以上ぶり入荷\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260821-461602-header.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>KOMODOは8月21日、「Steam Deck OLED」の日本国内発送分について、次回の入荷が8月25日午前10時頃になることを明かした。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260821-461602/","timestamp":"2026-08-21T02:48:38Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"最大4人協力・おもちゃ整頓ゲーム『Put Your Toys Away Together!』発表。散らかりまくりな「2万個のおもちゃ」を元通りに、遊んだ覚えはないけど\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260821-461575-header.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>Polden Publishingは8月21日、Toxic Studioが手がける『Put Your Toys Away Together!』を発表した。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260821-461575/","timestamp":"2026-08-21T02:12:51Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"最大4人協力“やりたい放題”釣りシム『How to Fish』、さっそく同接2万人超えで人気爆発中。捕れれば銃でもなんでもOK、誤射もギャンブルもある無法漁師生活\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260821-461559-header.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>Dazed Gamesは8月20日、『How to Fish』を配信開始した。最大同時接続プレイヤー数が約2万人となるなど、注目を集めている。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260821-461559/","timestamp":"2026-08-21T01:42:02Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"Steamの「ゲイブ」久々のご尊顔、髭さっぱり“ハンサム化”でファン沸き立つ。痩せてたけどさらに痩せる\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260821-461553-header.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>「The International 2026」のプレイオフが開催中。オープニングセレモニーにおいてGabe Newell氏がビデオメッセージを公開。以前よりもさらに痩せたその姿がネット上で話題となっている。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260821-461553/","timestamp":"2026-08-21T01:09:23Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
